a5b", "message": "always init the debug var so that it gets reset on reload of the .ps1", "created_at": "2012-06-18T23:17:16Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b11aa4af4542196e043a4b6224b6c78389a3b73", "message": "Write out the spec for the changelist being diff'd to the base dir. Will be useful when doing offline work.", "created_at": "2012-05-24T18:17:25Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04d0c3b6224f65f7fd0f83bd2a20a317711f4497", "message": "[p4nano] Fun new features\n\n* Support for -whatif\n* Uses userspec's \"reviews\" field to strip out files that user probably isn't interested in (can disable)\n* Option to disable the actual diff if we just want to copy the files\n* Option to change the base output folder for later reuse\n* Option to do \"split folders\" view that does a before-and-after of parallel file trees, which is great for offline diffing", "created_at": "2012-05-24T17:36:47Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7ce428db88b8819ef50351d4c568e261d77fbc49", "message": "fixed issue with last value item not getting included", "created_at": "2012-05-01T05:43:16Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce9ac7a2c8159c3b77e54e8ee8c87e0915c7799d", "message": "maybe i'll test it before checking in", "created_at": "2012-05-01T04:00:10Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c62526925f142bee5b8fefadd338664c52784f25", "message": "bugfix", "created_at": "2012-05-01T03:55:35Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b445950fad4a9d5c2cbfa12c18212e032f27b0a7", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'", "created_at": "2012-05-01T03:46:31Z", "repo": "p4nano", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_